    "# Dar Al-Hekma University 📖\n",
    "# Generativerse Club-CS Department-Male Section 🌌\n",
    "# Introuduction to Machine Learning Workshop 👨‍💻\n",
    "# Created by: Abdullah Alsadiq Muhammed\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Problem Definition\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1.1 The Business Problem\n",
    "\n",
    "Imagine you are working as a data analyst for a used-car dealership. Every day, sellers and buyers need to determine a fair price for a vehicle. Setting the price too high may discourage potential buyers, while setting it too low can lead to financial losses for the seller.\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Problem Statement:** *Can we use a car's characteristics and history to predict its selling price?*\n",
    "\n",
    "Key factors such as the vehicle's age, fuel type, mileage, engine capacity, ownership history, and transmission type may influence its market value. By analyzing these factors, we aim to build a machine learning model capable of estimating a car's selling price.\n",
    "\n",
    "<br><br>\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1.2 Why is Price Prediction Useful?\n",
    "\n",
    "| Variable | Description |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| **name** | Identifies the car model and variant, which strongly influences market value |\n",
    "| **year** | Indicates the vehicle's age; newer cars generally have higher prices |\n",
    "| **km_driven** | Measures vehicle usage; higher mileage often reduces value |\n",
    "| **fuel** | Different fuel types may affect demand and resale value |\n",
    "| **seller_type** | Indicates whether the seller is an individual or a dealer |\n",
    "| **transmission** | Manual and automatic vehicles may have different market prices |\n",
    "| **owner** | Reflects ownership history, which may influence buyer confidence |\n",
    "| **mileage** | Represents fuel efficiency and can affect desirability |\n",
    "| **engine** | Engine capacity often relates to vehicle performance and price |\n",
    "| **max_power** | Indicates the maximum power output of the engine |\n",
    "| **torque** | Measures engine pulling power and overall performance |\n",
    "| **seats** | Describes passenger capacity of the vehicle |\n",
    "| **selling_price** | Target variable representing the market price of the vehicle |\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Requirements 📦\n",
    "List the tools, libraries, or datasets required for your project.\n",
    "\n",
    "- Python 3.14.6 in Anaconda Environment\n",
    "- NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib, Seaborn  \n",
    "- scikit‑learn\n",
    "- Anaconda Environment\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Importing Libraries\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
